                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.03372"} arXiv:2305.03372
          %p
            Construction and axiomatization of gauge field AQFT via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopical+algebra"} homotopical algebra
            is being developed in
          %ul
